With the introduction of subvolume v3, existing subvolumes of previous versions
(v2, v1 and v0 (legacy)) are auto-upgraded to v3 as soon as they are discovered
by the volumes plugin. Discovery of subvolume happens when "ceph fs subvolume"
command is executed for it.

This test suite tests runs the helper code to create a subvolume of previous
version, starts a workload, starts Ceph cluster upgrade and then executes a
"ceph fs subvolume" command which initiates the subvolume auto-upgrade while the
workload is stil on.
